---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Paranjape Blue Ridge Hinjewadi"
  description="Privacy Policy and personal data protection principles for users of the Paranjape Blue Ridge information and sales portal."
  pathname="/privacy-policy"
>
  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 bg-[#FAF9F6] text-[#070D1A]">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <div class="mb-10 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-xs font-mono text-[#785415] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-4">
          Statutory Compliance • DPDP Act 2023 & GDPR
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A] tracking-tight mb-3">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-slate-500">
          Last Updated: September 2026 • Paranjape Blue Ridge Sovereign Portal
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-8 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        
        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">1. Introduction & Overview</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy governs the collection, storage, processing, and protection of personal identification information (PII) collected from visitors and homebuyers navigating <strong>paranjapeblueridge.com</strong> ("the Website"). We are dedicated to maintaining strict transparency and user trust in full adherence to the <em>Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP Act 2023)</em> of India and international best practices.
          </p>
          <p>
            By interacting with this portal, submitting an enquiry, or requesting architectural floor plans and price sheets, you acknowledge and agree to the practices outlined herein.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We may collect information you directly submit via our VIP site visit booking forms, brochure request modals, and WhatsApp contact conduits:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Personal Contact Data:</strong> Full Name, Primary Mobile Number, Email Address, and Country Code.</li>
            <li><strong>Property Preferences:</strong> Desired Configuration (2, 3, 4, or 5 BHK), Investment Budget, and Target Possession Timeline.</li>
            <li><strong>Automated Telemetry:</strong> Anonymized analytical data, IP address geolocation (country/city level), browser type, and referrer logs to maintain portal uptime and performance.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">3. How Your Information Is Utilized</h2>
          <p>Information gathered is strictly utilized for legitimate real estate advisory and transactional facilitation:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>To transmit requested PDF brochures, floor plans, cost sheets, and construction milestone updates.</li>
            <li>To coordinate authorized site visits to the Paranjape Blue Ridge Sales Gallery in Hinjewadi Phase 1, Pune.</li>
            <li>To verify home loan eligibility and connect prospective purchasers with empanelled banking partners (SBI, HDFC, ICICI, Axis).</li>
            <li>To ensure compliance with Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act (RERA) statutory record-keeping.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-800">
            We operate a zero-spam policy: Your personal data is never sold, leased, or rented to unauthorized third-party marketing brokers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">4. Cookies & Consent Mode v2</h2>
          <p>
            The Website deploys Google Consent Mode v2 to respect individual privacy preferences. Analytics and telemetry scripts are loaded with explicit consent tags (ad_storage, analytics_storage) and strict data minimization principles. You retain the ability to configure or disable cookies via your browser settings at any juncture.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">5. Data Security & Storage</h2>
          <p>
            All data transmitted through our web interfaces is protected by 256-bit TLS/SSL encryption and processed across Cloudflare Edge security infrastructure with Tier-1 firewall protections.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">6. Grievance Officer & Contact Details</h2>
          <p>
            For any questions, data access requests, or consent withdrawals, please address your correspondence to our designated privacy officer:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 font-mono text-xs space-y-1 text-slate-700">
            <div><strong>Entity:</strong> Paranjape Blue Ridge Advisory Desk</div>
            <div><strong>Location:</strong> Blue Ridge Township, Phase 1, Hinjewadi, Pune 411057</div>
            <div><strong>Email:</strong> privacy@paranjapeblueridge.com • propsmartrealty@gmail.com</div>
            <div><strong>Helpline:</strong> +91-20-67210000</div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="btn-champagne px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest no-underline inline-block shadow-sm">
          &larr; Return to Blue Ridge Home
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
